<title>POLAND: Komunalny Q2 net falls to PLN 1.6 mln.</title>
<headline>Komunalny Q2 net falls to PLN 1.6 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Komunalny SA preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997     Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 2.64  vs    2.73</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   2.64  vs    2.73</p>
<p>    net profit				 1.56  vs    1.78</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Bank Komunalny SA.</p>
<p>    revenues from securities	     0.01  vs    0.01</p>
